<metadata><name>Day 66 (stop 2 of 2) - Rural Rocks, Obese</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.753489" lon="-81.167505"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>From Wiarton, take Bruce Rd 13 west for 2 km to Northacres Rd. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.753673" lon="-81.168372"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Rural Rocks Side Trail, heading west. (the blue-blazed Rural Rocks Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.753409" lon="-81.170594"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Obese Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed Rural Rocks Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.753452" lon="-81.172136"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Rural Rocks Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed Rural Rocks Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
